#. ja: 古豪クラン員の手記
#. de: Clan-Doyen-Jägertagebuch
#. fr: journal de membre vétéran du clan
#. column 2: doyen's Clan mark logs
#. column 8: A list of highly elite marks documented by the log's owner. It is unclear whether the marks within were ever slain by said owner, but the overuse of modifiers such as “ghastly,” “terrifying,” and “beyond all horrors that haunt the sleeping mind” in their descriptions suggests perhaps not. Though such documents were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless.
#. column 9: Doyen's Clan Mark Log
msgctxt "Item:23176:0:0"
msgid "doyen's Clan mark log"
msgstr "журнал охотника на метки клана-долгожителя"

#. de: Clan-Doyen-Jägertagebücher
#. fr: journaux de membre vétéran du clan
