#. ja: 紫雷水
#. de: Eimer[p] Götterzorn
#. fr: mesure de fulgurosève
#. column 2: pots of stormsap
#. column 8: The chemical composition of this milky violet liquid is unknown, but its color─reminiscent of a thundercloud illuminated by lightning─has given rise to rumors surrounding its origins that have led to the unfortunate electrocution of many a scholar and profiteer alike.
#. column 9: Stormsap
msgctxt "Item:23178:0:0"
msgid "pot of stormsap"
msgstr "банка грозового сока"

