#. ja: スピードベルト
#. de: Tempogürtel
#. fr: ceinture vitesse
#. column 2: speed belts
#. column 8: Before becoming obsolete due to advancements in tailoring, belts such as this were used for holding up trousers and the like. This particular design, however, has retained some modicum of value, or so the Calamity salvagers appear to believe.<br><br>[Can be exchanged with Calamity salvagers for a blitzring.]
#. column 9: Speed Belt
msgctxt "Item:23219:0:0"
msgid "speed belt"
msgstr "Пояс скорости"

#. de: Tempogürtel
#. fr: ceintures vitesse
#. column 0: speed belt
#. column 8: Before becoming obsolete due to advancements in tailoring, belts such as this were used for holding up trousers and the like. This particular design, however, has retained some modicum of value, or so the Calamity salvagers appear to believe.<br><br>[Can be exchanged with Calamity salvagers for a blitzring.]
#. column 9: Speed Belt
msgctxt "Item:23219:0:2"
msgid "speed belts"
msgstr "Пояса скорости"

#. ja: [遺失物管理人にてブリッツリングと引き換え可能]<br>かつて帯防具として流通していた品。今や一体型の防具が主流となったが、一部の好事家は特別な品と交換に応じてくれるようだ
#. de: Einst als Rüstungsteil beliebt, doch da heutzutage eher integrierte Komplettlösungen bevorzugt werden, nur noch als Erinnerungsstück zu gebrauchen. Dieses spezielle Design hat jedoch noch einen gewissen Wert. Kann beim Fundsachen-Verwalter gegen einen Blitzring eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Peut être échangée auprès d'un consigneur contre une bague bombardier.<br>Autrefois éléments distincts au sein d'une tenue, les ceintures et les accessoires portés à la taille sont de nos jours directement intégrés aux pièces de haut ou de bas de corps. Ce changement de mode a rendu les objets comme celui-ci obsolètes.
#. column 0: speed belt
#. column 2: speed belts
#. column 9: Speed Belt
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:23219:0:8"
msgid "Before becoming obsolete due to advancements in tailoring, belts such as this were used for holding up trousers and the like. This particular design, however, has retained some modicum of value, or so the Calamity salvagers appear to believe.<br><br>[Can be exchanged with Calamity salvagers for a blitzring.]"
msgstr "Пояса вроде этого когда-то носили, чтобы поддерживать штаны. Но с развитием портновского дела они вышли из употребления. Похоже, распорядители находок всё же считают, что эта модель ещё чего-то стоит.<br><br>[Можно обменять у распорядителей находок на кольцо-ускоритель.]"

