#. ja: 乱属性クリスタル【氷】
#. de: instabil[a] Eiskristall
#. fr: cristal instable de glace
#. column 2: frosted protean crystals
#. column 8: Hastily forged from the aspected aether of slain beasts, this crystal quickly accumulated a fragile veneer of ice when exposed to the frigid air of Pagos. Its energies have yet to settle─if indeed they ever will.
#. column 9: Frosted Protean Crystal
msgctxt "Item:23309:0:0"
msgid "frosted protean crystal"
msgstr "Обледенелый нестабильный кристалл"

#. de: instabil[a] Eiskristalle
#. fr: cristaux instables de glace
