#. ja: マネキン
#. de: Kleiderpuppe
#. fr: mannequin
#. column 2: mannequins
#. column 8: Once the nightmare of shopkeeps alone, highly detailed models such as this one have gained popularity amongst adventurers as means of selling unneeded accoutrements, displaying hard-won ensembles, and unnerving unsuspecting visitors.<br><br>※Private chambers (apartments), cottages, houses, and mansions can hold 4, 6, 8, and 10 facilities, respectively.
#. column 9: Mannequin
msgctxt "Item:23846:0:0"
msgid "mannequin"
msgstr "манекен"

#. de: Kleiderpuppen
#. fr: mannequins
#. column 0: mannequin
#. column 8: Once the nightmare of shopkeeps alone, highly detailed models such as this one have gained popularity amongst adventurers as means of selling unneeded accoutrements, displaying hard-won ensembles, and unnerving unsuspecting visitors.<br><br>※Private chambers (apartments), cottages, houses, and mansions can hold 4, 6, 8, and 10 facilities, respectively.
#. column 9: Mannequin
msgctxt "Item:23846:0:2"
msgid "mannequins"
msgstr "манекены"

#. ja: 装備品の展示に利用できるマネキン人形<br>[マネキンは配置できる数が建物サイズで決まる(個室・アパルトメント:4個／S:6個／M:8個／L:10個)]
#. de: Einst waren sie nur der Albtraum von Modehändlern, doch in letzter Zeit erfreuen sich detaillierte Modelle wie dieses auch bei Abenteurern großer Beliebtheit, um damit nicht mehr benötigte Ausrüstung zum Verkauf anzubieten. (Pro Zimmer/Wohnung, Hütte, Haus bzw. Residenz sind 4, 6, 8 bzw. 10 Kleiderpuppen platzierbar.)
#. fr: Un mannequin permettant d'exposer et de vendre des objets.<br><br>[Les chambres individuelles et les appartements peuvent contenir 4 mannequins, les maisonnettes, pavillons et villas sont respectivement limités à 6, 8 et 10.]
#. column 0: mannequin
#. column 2: mannequins
#. column 9: Mannequin
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:23846:0:8"
msgid "Once the nightmare of shopkeeps alone, highly detailed models such as this one have gained popularity amongst adventurers as means of selling unneeded accoutrements, displaying hard-won ensembles, and unnerving unsuspecting visitors.<br><br>※Private chambers (apartments), cottages, houses, and mansions can hold 4, 6, 8, and 10 facilities, respectively."
msgstr "Подробные манекены, прежде пугавшие одних лишь хозяев лавок, теперь популярны и среди искателей приключений. На них можно выставлять ненужное снаряжение на продажу, демонстрировать добытые с трудом наряды и пугать ничего не подозревающих гостей.<br><br>※В личной комнате, апартаментах, коттедже, доме и особняке можно разместить 4, 6, 8 и 10 манекенов соответственно."

