#. ja: アルファスケープ
#. de: Alphametrie-Kristalloid
#. fr: cristalloïde alphastitiel
#. column 2: Alphascape crystalloids
#. column 8: A remarkable crystalline fragment within which can be seen images from another world. Though such articles were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up, leaving them with little value as bartering materials.
#. column 9: Alphascape Crystalloid
msgctxt "Item:23974:0:0"
msgid "Alphascape crystalloid"
msgstr "кристаллоид Альфаскейпа"

#. de: Alphametrie-Kristalloide
#. fr: cristalloïdes alphastitiels
#. column 0: Alphascape crystalloid
#. column 8: A remarkable crystalline fragment within which can be seen images from another world. Though such articles were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up, leaving them with little value as bartering materials.
#. column 9: Alphascape Crystalloid
msgctxt "Item:23974:0:2"
msgid "Alphascape crystalloids"
msgstr "кристаллоиды Альфаскейпа"

#. ja: 次元の狭間で手に入れた、謎の景色を映す物体。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ein außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>liches Kristallfragment, das einen Blick in eine andere Welt ermöglicht. Einst leckten sich Sammler die Finger nach dieser Rarität, doch heutzutage findet man dafür keine Abnehmer mehr.
#. fr: Un mystérieux objet récupéré dans un engrenage alphastitiel et dans lequel on aperçoit un étrange paysage. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, ils ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: Alphascape crystalloid
#. column 2: Alphascape crystalloids
#. column 9: Alphascape Crystalloid
msgctxt "Item:23974:0:8"
msgid "A remarkable crystalline fragment within which can be seen images from another world. Though such articles were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up, leaving them with little value as bartering materials."
msgstr "Удивительный кристаллический осколок, в котором видны образы иного мира. Когда-то такие осколки высоко ценились, но спрос давно угас, и теперь обменять их почти не на что."

#. ja: アルファスケープ
#. de: Alphametrie-Kristalloid
#. fr: Cristalloïde alphastitiel
#. column 0: Alphascape crystalloid
#. column 2: Alphascape crystalloids
#. column 8: A remarkable crystalline fragment within which can be seen images from another world. Though such articles were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up, leaving them with little value as bartering materials.
msgctxt "Item:23974:0:9"
msgid "Alphascape Crystalloid"
msgstr "Кристаллоид Альфаскейпа"

#. ja: スカエウァ特製強化薬
#. de: Phiole[p] Scaeva-Tinktur
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant Scaeva
#. column 2: flasks of Scaevan ester
#. column 8: A lubricant concocted by a certain Garlond Ironworks consultant that, when applied to weapons of similar origin, heightens their attributes by smoothing interactions between their many interlocking parts. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Scaevan Ester
msgctxt "Item:23975:0:0"
msgid "flask of Scaevan ester"
msgstr "флакон эфира Скаэвы"

#. de: Phiolen[p] Scaeva-Tinktur
#. fr: fioles d'agent renforçant Scaeva
#. column 0: flask of Scaevan ester
#. column 8: A lubricant concocted by a certain Garlond Ironworks consultant that, when applied to weapons of similar origin, heightens their attributes by smoothing interactions between their many interlocking parts. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Scaevan Ester
msgctxt "Item:23975:0:2"
msgid "flasks of Scaevan ester"
msgstr "флаконы эфира Скаэвы"

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社の大型新人が開発した錬金薬。<br>スカエウァ武器の改良に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【武器】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Dieses Fläschchen enthält eine zähflüssige Tinktur, mit der sich Scaeva-Waffen verbessern lassen.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Waffen benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Une mixture alchimique développée par un élément surdoué des Forges de Garlond. Elle permettait d'améliorer l'efficacité des armes de style Scaeva. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: flask of Scaevan ester
#. column 2: flasks of Scaevan ester
#. column 9: Scaevan Ester
msgctxt "Item:23975:0:8"
msgid "A lubricant concocted by a certain Garlond Ironworks consultant that, when applied to weapons of similar origin, heightens their attributes by smoothing interactions between their many interlocking parts. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Смазка, созданная одним из консультантов инженеров «Топсейл». При нанесении на оружие Скаэвы она улучшает его характеристики, облегчая взаимодействие множества сцепленных деталей. Но с развитием технологий изготовления снаряжения смазка устарела."

#. ja: スカエウァ特製強化薬
#. de: Scaeva-Tinktur
#. fr: Agent renforçant Scaeva
#. column 0: flask of Scaevan ester
#. column 2: flasks of Scaevan ester
#. column 8: A lubricant concocted by a certain Garlond Ironworks consultant that, when applied to weapons of similar origin, heightens their attributes by smoothing interactions between their many interlocking parts. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
msgctxt "Item:23975:0:9"
msgid "Scaevan Ester"
msgstr "Эфир Скаэвы"

#. ja: スカエウァ特製強化繊維
#. de: Ballen[p] Scaeva-Gewebe
#. fr: rouleau de fibre renforcée Scaeva
#. column 2: spools of Scaevan twine
#. column 8: A sturdy fiber devised by a certain Garlond Ironworks consultant for the purpose of heightening the attributes of armor of his own design. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Scaevan Twine
msgctxt "Item:23976:0:0"
msgid "spool of Scaevan twine"
msgstr "моток твина Скаэвы"

