#. column 2: phials of Scaevan shellac
#. column 8: A fixing agent concocted by a certain Garlond Ironworks consultant that, when applied to accessories of similar origin, heightens their attributes by rebuffing vapor penetration and insulating delicate internal mechanisms. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
