msgstr "Вексель Ровены (сотворение)"

#. ja: 軍用トームストーン
#. de: militärisch[a] Allagisch[a] Stein
#. fr: mémoquartz militaire allagois
#. column 2: military-grade tomestones
#. column 8: The exacting specifications to which this tomestone was made, along with its half-deciphered contents, have led Ironworks engineers to believe that it was manufactured for exclusive use by the Allagan armed forces. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Military-grade Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:23979:0:0"
msgid "military-grade tomestone"
msgstr "военный камень"

#. de: militärisch[a] Allagisch[a] Steine
#. fr: mémoquartz militaires allagois
#. column 0: military-grade tomestone
#. column 8: The exacting specifications to which this tomestone was made, along with its half-deciphered contents, have led Ironworks engineers to believe that it was manufactured for exclusive use by the Allagan armed forces. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Military-grade Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:23979:0:2"
msgid "military-grade tomestones"
msgstr "военные камни"

#. ja: 古代の情報が記されたアラグ文明の遺物。アラグ帝国軍で利用するための特殊規格に対応している。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Die sehr exakt eingehaltenen Informationen und einige Datenreste führten die Ingenieure der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke zu der Vermutung, dass diese Steine vom allagischen Militär verwendet wurden. Heute interessiert sich offenbar niemand mehr für diese Objekte.
#. fr: Cette pierre, vestige de la civilisation allagoise, renferme des con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ces ancestrales. Après analyse, les ingénieurs des Forges de Garlond ont conclu que sa création n'avait pour but qu'une utilisation militaire. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: military-grade tomestone
#. column 2: military-grade tomestones
#. column 9: Military-grade Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:23979:0:8"
msgid "The exacting specifications to which this tomestone was made, along with its half-deciphered contents, have led Ironworks engineers to believe that it was manufactured for exclusive use by the Allagan armed forces. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares."
msgstr "Тщательная проработка камня и лишь отчасти расшифрованное содержимое навели инженеров «Топсейл» на мысль, что его изготовили специально для армии Аллаганской империи. Когда-то камни этой разновидности пользовались спросом, но теперь их больше не обменивают на другие товары."

#. ja: 軍用トームストーン
#. de: Militärischer Allagischer Stein
#. fr: Mémoquartz militaire allagois
#. column 0: military-grade tomestone
#. column 2: military-grade tomestones
#. column 8: The exacting specifications to which this tomestone was made, along with its half-deciphered contents, have led Ironworks engineers to believe that it was manufactured for exclusive use by the Allagan armed forces. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
msgctxt "Item:23979:0:9"
msgid "Military-grade Tomestone"
msgstr "Военный томстоун"

